# CodeAlpha Task 1 - Network Sniffer

## Description
A Python-based network sniffer developed using Scapy for the CodeAlpha Cyber Security Internship.

## Features
- Captures IP packets
- Displays source and destination IP addresses
- Identifies TCP, UDP and ICMP protocols
- Displays source and destination ports
- Displays packet payload size

## Technologies
- Python
- Scapy
- Kali Linux

## How to Run
sudo ./venv/bin/python network_sniffer.py

## Testing
The sniffer was tested using authorized traffic generated from the local machine using ping and HTTPS requests.

